    "contentHtml": "<h1 id=\"gamingsetvaries\">Gaming Set (Varies)</h1>\n<p><strong>Ability:</strong> Wisdom </p>\n<p><strong>Weight:</strong> — </p>\n<p><strong>Utilize:</strong> Discern whether someone is cheating (DC 10), or win the game (DC 20) </p>\n<p><strong>Variants:</strong> Dice (1 SP), dragonchess (1 GP), playing cards (5 SP), three-dragon ante (1 GP)</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Source: 5.2 SRD (D&D 2024) - Tools</em></p>",
