    "content": "Lock (10 GP) A Lock comes with a key. Without the key, a creature can use Thieves' Tools to pick this Lock with a successful DC 15 Dexterity (Sleight of Hand) check. Source: 5.2 SRD (D&D 2024) - Adventuring Gear",
