    "contentHtml": "<h1 id=\"navigatorstools25gp\">Navigator's Tools (25 GP)</h1>\n<p><strong>Ability:</strong> Wisdom </p>\n<p><strong>Weight:</strong> 2 lb. </p>\n<p><strong>Utilize:</strong> Plot a course (DC 10), or determine position by stargazing (DC 15)</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Source: 5.2 SRD (D&D 2024) - Tools</em></p>",
