    "title": "Burning Hands",
    "filename": "07_Burning_Hands.md",
    "content": "Burning Hands Level 1 Evocation (Sorcerer, Wizard) Casting Time: Action Range: Self Components: V, S Duration: Instantaneous A thin sheet of flames shoots forth from you. Each creature in a 15-foot Cone makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. Flammable objects in the Cone that aren't being worn or carried start burning. Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1. C Spells",
    "contentHtml": "<h4 id=\"burninghands\">Burning Hands</h4>\n<p><em>Level 1 Evocation (Sorcerer, Wizard)</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> Action </p>\n<p><strong>Range:</strong> Self </p>\n<p><strong>Components:</strong> V, S </p>\n<p><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</p>\n<p>A thin sheet of flames shoots forth from you. Each creature in a 15-foot Cone makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.</p>\n<p>Flammable objects in the Cone that aren't being worn or carried start burning.</p>\n<p><strong><em>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</em></strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.</p>\n<h3 id=\"cspells\">C Spells</h3>",
