    "id": 202,
    "title": "Chill Touch",
    "filename": "07_Chill_Touch.md",
    "content": "Chill Touch Necromancy Cantrip (Sorcerer, Warlock, Wizard) Casting Time: Action Range: Touch Components: V, S Duration: Instantaneous Channeling the chill of the grave, make a melee spell attack against a target within reach. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Necrotic damage, and it can't regain Hit Points until the end of your next turn. Cantrip Upgrade. The damage increases by 1d10 when you reach levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10).",
    "contentHtml": "<h4 id=\"chilltouch\">Chill Touch</h4>\n<p><em>Necromancy Cantrip (Sorcerer, Warlock, Wizard)</em></p>\n<p><strong>Casting Time:</strong> Action </p>\n<p><strong>Range:</strong> Touch </p>\n<p><strong>Components:</strong> V, S </p>\n<p><strong>Duration:</strong> Instantaneous</p>\n<p>Channeling the chill of the grave, make a melee spell attack against a target within reach. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Necrotic damage, and it can't regain Hit Points until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong><em>Cantrip Upgrade.</em></strong> The damage increases by 1d10 when you reach levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10).</p>",
    "url": "./html/07_Chill_Touch.html"
