    "content": "Weapon Attack A weapon attack is an attack roll made with a weapon. See also \"Weapon.\"",
    "contentHtml": "<h4 id=\"weaponattack\">Weapon Attack</h4>\n<p>A weapon attack is an attack roll made with a weapon. <em>See also</em> \"Weapon.\"</p>",
    "url": "./html/08_Weapon_Attack.html"
