    "title": "Boots of Levitation",
    "filename": "10_Boots_of_Levitation.md",
    "content": "Boots of Levitation Wondrous Item, Rare (Requires Attunement) While you wear these boots, you can cast Levitate on yourself.",
    "contentHtml": "<h4 id=\"bootsoflevitation\">Boots of Levitation</h4>\n<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p>\n<p>While you wear these boots, you can cast <em>Levitate</em> on yourself.</p>",
