    "contentHtml": "<h4 id=\"potionofclimbing\">Potion of Climbing</h4>\n<p><em>Potion, Common</em></p>\n<p>When you drink this potion, you gain a Climb Speed equal to your Speed for 1 hour. During this time, you have Advantage on Strength (Athletics) checks to climb.</p>\n<p>This potion is separated into brown, silver, and gray layers resembling bands of stone. Shaking the bottle fails to mix the colors.</p>",
