    "contentHtml": "<h4 id=\"potionofdiminution\">Potion of Diminution</h4>\n<p><em>Potion, Rare</em></p>\n<p>When you drink this potion, you gain the \"reduce\" effect of the <em>Enlarge/Reduce</em> spell for 1d4 hours (no Concentration required).</p>\n<p>The red in the potion's liquid continuously contracts to a tiny bead and then expands to color the clear liquid around it. Shaking the bottle fails to interrupt this process.</p>",
