    "contentHtml": "<h4 id=\"potionofgaseousform\">Potion of Gaseous Form</h4>\n<p><em>Potion, Rare</em></p>\n<p>When you drink this potion, you gain the effect of the <em>Gaseous Form</em> spell for 1 hour (no Concentration required) or until you end the effect as a Bonus Action.</p>\n<p>This potion's container seems to hold fog that moves and pours like water.</p>",
