    "contentHtml": "<h4 id=\"wandofsecrets\">Wand of Secrets</h4>\n<p><em>Wand, Uncommon</em> </p>\n<p>This wand has 3 charges and regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn. While holding it, you can take a Magic action to expend 1 charge, and if a secret door or trap is within 60 feet of you, the wand pulses and points at the one nearest to you.</p>",
