    "content": "Badger Small Beast, Unaligned - Armor Class: 11 - Hit Points: 5 (1d4 + 3) - Speed: 20 ft., Burrow 5 ft. - Initiative: +0 (10) |STAT|SCORE|MOD|SAVE| | --- | --- | --- | ---- | | STR | 10 | +0 | +0 | | DEX | 11 | +0 | +0 | | CON | 16 | +3 | +3 | | INT | 2 | -4 | -4 | | WIS | 12 | +1 | +1 | | CHA | 5 | -3 | -3 | - Resistances: Poison - Skills: Perception +3 - Senses: darkvision 30 ft.; Passive Perception 13 - CR 0 (XP 0 or 10; PB +2) Actions Bite. Melee Attack Roll: +2, reach 5 ft. 1 Piercing damage.",
    "contentHtml": "<h2 id=\"badger\">Badger</h2>\n<p><em>Small Beast, Unaligned</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 11</li>\n<li><strong>Hit Points:</strong> 5 (1d4 + 3)</li>\n<li><strong>Speed:</strong> 20 ft., Burrow 5 ft.</li>\n<li><strong>Initiative</strong>: +0 (10)</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>STAT</th>\n<th>SCORE</th>\n<th>MOD</th>\n<th>SAVE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>STR</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEX</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CON</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WIS</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHA</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Resistances</strong>: Poison</li>\n<li><strong>Skills</strong>: Perception +3</li>\n<li><strong>Senses</strong>: darkvision 30 ft.; Passive Perception 13</li>\n<li><strong>CR</strong> 0 (XP 0 or 10; PB +2)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"actions\">Actions</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Bite.</em></strong> <em>Melee Attack Roll:</em> +2, reach 5 ft. 1 Piercing damage.</p>",
