    "content": "Eagle Small Beast, Unaligned - Armor Class: 12 - Hit Points: 4 (1d6 + 1) - Speed: 10 ft., Fly 60 ft. - Initiative: +2 (12) |STAT|SCORE|MOD|SAVE| | --- | --- | --- | ---- | | STR | 6 | -2 | -2 | | DEX | 15 | +2 | +2 | | CON | 12 | +1 | +1 | | INT | 2 | -4 | -4 | | WIS | 14 | +2 | +2 | | CHA | 7 | -2 | -2 | - Skills: Perception +6 - Senses: Passive Perception 16 - CR 0 (XP 0 or 10; PB +2) Actions Talons. Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 feet. 4 (1d4 + 2) Slashing damage.",
    "contentHtml": "<h2 id=\"eagle\">Eagle</h2>\n<p><em>Small Beast, Unaligned</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 12</li>\n<li><strong>Hit Points:</strong> 4 (1d6 + 1)</li>\n<li><strong>Speed:</strong> 10 ft., Fly 60 ft.</li>\n<li><strong>Initiative</strong>: +2 (12)</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>STAT</th>\n<th>SCORE</th>\n<th>MOD</th>\n<th>SAVE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>STR</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEX</td>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CON</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WIS</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHA</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Skills</strong>: Perception +6</li>\n<li><strong>Senses</strong>: Passive Perception 16</li>\n<li><strong>CR</strong> 0 (XP 0 or 10; PB +2)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"actions\">Actions</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Talons.</em></strong> <em>Melee Attack Roll:</em> +4, reach 5 feet. 4 (1d4 + 2) Slashing damage.</p>",
    "url": "./html/12_Eagle.html"
