    "content": "Giant Weasel Medium Beast, Unaligned - Armor Class: 13 - Hit Points: 9 (2d8) - Speed: 40 ft., Climb 30 ft. - Initiative: +3 (13) |STAT|SCORE|MOD|SAVE| | --- | --- | --- | ---- | | STR | 11 | +0 | +0 | | DEX | 17 | +3 | +3 | | CON | 10 | +0 | +0 | | INT | 4 | -3 | -3 | | WIS | 12 | +1 | +1 | | CHA | 5 | -3 | -3 | - Skills: Acrobatics +5, Perception +3, Stealth +5 - Senses: darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 13 - CR 1/8 (XP 25; PB +2) Actions Bite. Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. 5 (1d4 + 3) Piercing damage.",
    "contentHtml": "<h2 id=\"giantweasel\">Giant Weasel</h2>\n<p><em>Medium Beast, Unaligned</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 13</li>\n<li><strong>Hit Points:</strong> 9 (2d8)</li>\n<li><strong>Speed:</strong> 40 ft., Climb 30 ft.</li>\n<li><strong>Initiative</strong>: +3 (13)</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>STAT</th>\n<th>SCORE</th>\n<th>MOD</th>\n<th>SAVE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>STR</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEX</td>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CON</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WIS</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHA</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Skills</strong>: Acrobatics +5, Perception +3, Stealth +5</li>\n<li><strong>Senses</strong>: darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 13</li>\n<li><strong>CR</strong> 1/8 (XP 25; PB +2)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"actions\">Actions</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Bite.</em></strong> <em>Melee Attack Roll:</em> +5, reach 5 ft. 5 (1d4 + 3) Piercing damage.</p>",
