    "content": "Goblin Minion Small Fey (Goblinoid), Chaotic Neutral - Armor Class: 12 - Hit Points: 7 (2d6) - Speed: 30 ft. - Initiative: +2 (12) |STAT|SCORE|MOD|SAVE| | --- | --- | --- | ---- | | STR | 8 | -1 | -1 | | DEX | 15 | +2 | +2 | | CON | 10 | +0 | +0 | | INT | 10 | +0 | +0 | | WIS | 8 | -1 | -1 | | CHA | 8 | -1 | -1 | - Skills: Stealth +6 - Gear Dagger x 3 - Senses: darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 9 - Languages: Common, Goblin - CR 1/8 (XP 25; PB +2) Actions Dagger. Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. or range 20/60 ft. 4 (1d4 + 2) Piercing damage. Bonus Actions Nimble Escape. The goblin takes the Disengage or Hide action.",
    "contentHtml": "<h2 id=\"goblinminion\">Goblin Minion</h2>\n<p><em>Small Fey (Goblinoid), Chaotic Neutral</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 12</li>\n<li><strong>Hit Points:</strong> 7 (2d6)</li>\n<li><strong>Speed:</strong> 30 ft.</li>\n<li><strong>Initiative</strong>: +2 (12)</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>STAT</th>\n<th>SCORE</th>\n<th>MOD</th>\n<th>SAVE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>STR</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEX</td>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CON</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WIS</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHA</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Skills</strong>: Stealth +6</li>\n<li><strong>Gear</strong> Dagger x 3</li>\n<li><strong>Senses</strong>: darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 9</li>\n<li><strong>Languages</strong>: Common, Goblin</li>\n<li><strong>CR</strong> 1/8 (XP 25; PB +2)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"actions\">Actions</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Dagger.</em></strong> <em>Melee or Ranged Attack Roll:</em> +4, reach 5 ft. or range 20/60 ft. 4 (1d4 + 2) Piercing damage.</p>\n<h3 id=\"bonusactions\">Bonus Actions</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Nimble Escape.</em></strong> The goblin takes the Disengage or Hide action.</p>",
