    "id": 1083,
    "title": "Hippogriff",
    "filename": "12_Hippogriff.md",
    "content": "Hippogriff Large Monstrosity, Unaligned - Armor Class: 11 - Hit Points: 26 (4d10 + 4) - Speed: 40 ft., Fly 60 ft. - Initiative: +1 (11) |STAT|SCORE|MOD|SAVE| | --- | --- | --- | ---- | | STR | 17 | +3 | +3 | | DEX | 13 | +1 | +1 | | CON | 13 | +1 | +1 | | INT | 2 | -4 | -4 | | WIS | 12 | +1 | +1 | | CHA | 8 | -1 | -1 | - Skills: Perception +5 - Senses: Passive Perception 15 - CR 1 (XP 200; PB +2) Traits Flyby. The hippogriff doesn't provoke an Opportunity Attack when it flies out of an enemy's reach. Actions Multiattack. The hippogriff makes two Rend attacks. Rend. Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. 7 (1d8 + 3) Slashing damage.",
    "contentHtml": "<h2 id=\"hippogriff\">Hippogriff</h2>\n<p><em>Large Monstrosity, Unaligned</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 11</li>\n<li><strong>Hit Points:</strong> 26 (4d10 + 4)</li>\n<li><strong>Speed:</strong> 40 ft., Fly 60 ft.</li>\n<li><strong>Initiative</strong>: +1 (11)</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>STAT</th>\n<th>SCORE</th>\n<th>MOD</th>\n<th>SAVE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>STR</td>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEX</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CON</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WIS</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHA</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Skills</strong>: Perception +5</li>\n<li><strong>Senses</strong>: Passive Perception 15</li>\n<li><strong>CR</strong> 1 (XP 200; PB +2)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"traits\">Traits</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Flyby.</em></strong> The hippogriff doesn't provoke an Opportunity Attack when it flies out of an enemy's reach.</p>\n<h3 id=\"actions\">Actions</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Multiattack.</em></strong> The hippogriff makes two Rend attacks.</p>\n<p><strong><em>Rend.</em></strong> <em>Melee Attack Roll:</em> +5, reach 5 ft. 7 (1d8 + 3) Slashing damage.</p>",
    "url": "./html/12_Hippogriff.html"
