    "id": 1091,
    "title": "Hyena",
    "filename": "12_Hyena.md",
    "content": "Hyena Medium Beast, Unaligned - Armor Class: 11 - Hit Points: 5 (1d8 + 1) - Speed: 50 ft. - Initiative: +1 (11) |STAT|SCORE|MOD|SAVE| | --- | --- | --- | ---- | | STR | 11 | +0 | +0 | | DEX | 13 | +1 | +1 | | CON | 12 | +1 | +1 | | INT | 2 | -4 | -4 | | WIS | 12 | +1 | +1 | | CHA | 5 | -3 | -3 | - Skills: Perception +3 - Senses: darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 13 - CR 0 (XP 0 or 10; PB +2) Traits Pack Tactics. The hyena has Advantage on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the hyena's allies is within 5 feet of the creature and the ally doesn't have the Incapacitated condition. Actions Bite. Melee Attack Roll: +2, reach 5 ft. 3 (1d6) Piercing damage.",
    "contentHtml": "<h2 id=\"hyena\">Hyena</h2>\n<p><em>Medium Beast, Unaligned</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 11</li>\n<li><strong>Hit Points:</strong> 5 (1d8 + 1)</li>\n<li><strong>Speed:</strong> 50 ft.</li>\n<li><strong>Initiative</strong>: +1 (11)</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>STAT</th>\n<th>SCORE</th>\n<th>MOD</th>\n<th>SAVE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>STR</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEX</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CON</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WIS</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHA</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Skills</strong>: Perception +3</li>\n<li><strong>Senses</strong>: darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 13</li>\n<li><strong>CR</strong> 0 (XP 0 or 10; PB +2)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"traits\">Traits</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Pack Tactics.</em></strong> The hyena has Advantage on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the hyena's allies is within 5 feet of the creature and the ally doesn't have the Incapacitated condition.</p>\n<h3 id=\"actions\">Actions</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Bite.</em></strong> <em>Melee Attack Roll:</em> +2, reach 5 ft. 3 (1d6) Piercing damage.</p>",
    "url": "./html/12_Hyena.html"
