    "contentHtml": "<h2 id=\"plesiosaurus\">Plesiosaurus</h2>\n<p><em>Large Beast (Dinosaur), Unaligned</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 13</li>\n<li><strong>Hit Points:</strong> 68 (8d10 + 24)</li>\n<li><strong>Speed:</strong> 20 ft., Swim 40 ft.</li>\n<li><strong>Initiative</strong>: +2 (12)</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>STAT</th>\n<th>SCORE</th>\n<th>MOD</th>\n<th>SAVE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>STR</td>\n<td>18</td>\n<td>+4</td>\n<td>+4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEX</td>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CON</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WIS</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHA</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Skills</strong>: Perception +3, Stealth +4</li>\n<li><strong>Senses</strong>: Passive Perception 13</li>\n<li><strong>CR</strong> 2 (XP 450; PB +2)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"traits\">Traits</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Hold Breath.</em></strong> The plesiosaurus can hold its breath for 1 hour.</p>\n<h3 id=\"actions\">Actions</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Bite.</em></strong> <em>Melee Attack Roll:</em> +6, reach 10 ft. 11 (2d6 + 4) Piercing damage.</p>",
    "url": "./html/12_Plesiosaurus.html"
