    "content": "Polar Bear Large Beast, Unaligned - Armor Class: 12 - Hit Points: 42 (5d10 + 15) - Speed: 40 ft., Swim 40 ft. - Initiative: +2 (12) |STAT|SCORE|MOD|SAVE| | --- | --- | --- | ---- | | STR | 20 | +5 | +5 | | DEX | 14 | +2 | +2 | | CON | 16 | +3 | +3 | | INT | 2 | -4 | -4 | | WIS | 13 | +1 | +1 | | CHA | 7 | -2 | -2 | - Resistances: Cold - Skills: Perception +5, Stealth +4 - Senses: darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 15 - CR 2 (XP 450; PB +2) Actions Multiattack. The bear makes two Rend attacks. Rend. Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. 9 (1d8 + 5) Slashing damage.",
    "contentHtml": "<h2 id=\"polarbear\">Polar Bear</h2>\n<p><em>Large Beast, Unaligned</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 12</li>\n<li><strong>Hit Points:</strong> 42 (5d10 + 15)</li>\n<li><strong>Speed:</strong> 40 ft., Swim 40 ft.</li>\n<li><strong>Initiative</strong>: +2 (12)</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>STAT</th>\n<th>SCORE</th>\n<th>MOD</th>\n<th>SAVE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>STR</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>+5</td>\n<td>+5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEX</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CON</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WIS</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHA</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Resistances</strong>: Cold</li>\n<li><strong>Skills</strong>: Perception +5, Stealth +4</li>\n<li><strong>Senses</strong>: darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 15</li>\n<li><strong>CR</strong> 2 (XP 450; PB +2)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"actions\">Actions</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Multiattack.</em></strong> The bear makes two Rend attacks.</p>\n<p><strong><em>Rend.</em></strong> <em>Melee Attack Roll:</em> +7, reach 5 ft. 9 (1d8 + 5) Slashing damage.</p>",
