    "contentHtml": "<h2 id=\"youngbluedragon\">Young Blue Dragon</h2>\n<p><em>Large Dragon (Chromatic), Lawful Evil</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 18</li>\n<li><strong>Hit Points:</strong> 152 (16d10 + 64)</li>\n<li><strong>Speed:</strong> 40 ft., Burrow 20 ft., Fly 80 ft.</li>\n<li><strong>Initiative</strong>: +4 (14)</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>STAT</th>\n<th>SCORE</th>\n<th>MOD</th>\n<th>SAVE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>STR</td>\n<td>21</td>\n<td>+5</td>\n<td>+5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEX</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n<td>+4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CON</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>+4</td>\n<td>+4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n<td>+2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WIS</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHA</td>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Immunities</strong>: Lightning</li>\n<li><strong>Skills</strong>: Perception +9, Stealth +4</li>\n<li><strong>Senses</strong>: blindsight 30 ft., darkvision 120 ft.; Passive Perception 19</li>\n<li><strong>Languages</strong>: Common, Draconic</li>\n<li><strong>CR</strong> 9 (XP 5,000; PB +4)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"actions\">Actions</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Multiattack.</em></strong> The dragon makes three Rend attacks.</p>\n<p><strong><em>Rend.</em></strong> <em>Melee Attack Roll:</em> +9, reach 10 ft. 12 (2d6 + 5) Slashing damage plus 5 (1d10) Lightning damage.</p>\n<p><strong><em>Lightning Breath (Recharge 5-6).</em></strong> <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em>: DC 16, each creature in a 60-foot-long, 5-foot-wide Line. <em>Failure:</em>  55 (10d10) Lightning damage. <em>Success:</em>  Half damage.</p>",
