    "title": "Allosaurus",
    "filename": "13_Allosaurus.md",
    "content": "Allosaurus Large Beast (Dinosaur), Unaligned - Armor Class: 13 - Hit Points: 51 (6d10 + 18) - Speed: 60 ft. - Initiative: +1 (11) |STAT|SCORE|MOD|SAVE| | --- | --- | --- | ---- | | STR | 19 | +4 | +4 | | DEX | 13 | +1 | +1 | | CON | 17 | +3 | +3 | | INT | 2 | -4 | -4 | | WIS | 12 | +1 | +1 | | CHA | 5 | -3 | -3 | - Skills: Perception +5 - Senses: Passive Perception 15 - CR 2 (XP 450; PB +2) Actions Bite. Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. 15 (2d10 + 4) Piercing damage. Claws. Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. 8 (1d8 + 4) Slashing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature and the allosaurus moved 30+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target has the Prone condition, and the allosaurus can make one Bite attack against it.",
    "contentHtml": "<h2 id=\"allosaurus\">Allosaurus</h2>\n<p><em>Large Beast (Dinosaur), Unaligned</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 13</li>\n<li><strong>Hit Points:</strong> 51 (6d10 + 18)</li>\n<li><strong>Speed:</strong> 60 ft.</li>\n<li><strong>Initiative</strong>: +1 (11)</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>STAT</th>\n<th>SCORE</th>\n<th>MOD</th>\n<th>SAVE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>STR</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>+4</td>\n<td>+4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEX</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CON</td>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WIS</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHA</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n<td>-3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Skills</strong>: Perception +5</li>\n<li><strong>Senses</strong>: Passive Perception 15</li>\n<li><strong>CR</strong> 2 (XP 450; PB +2)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"actions\">Actions</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Bite.</em></strong> <em>Melee Attack Roll:</em> +6, reach 5 ft. 15 (2d10 + 4) Piercing damage.</p>\n<p><strong><em>Claws.</em></strong> <em>Melee Attack Roll:</em> +6, reach 5 ft. 8 (1d8 + 4) Slashing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature and the allosaurus moved 30+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target has the Prone condition, and the allosaurus can make one Bite attack against it.</p>",
    "url": "./html/13_Allosaurus.html"
