    "id": 1267,
    "title": "Elephant",
    "filename": "13_Elephant.md",
    "content": "Elephant Huge Beast, Unaligned - Armor Class: 12 - Hit Points: 76 (8d12 + 24) - Speed: 40 ft. - Initiative: -1 (9) |STAT|SCORE|MOD|SAVE| | --- | --- | --- | ---- | | STR | 22 | +6 | +6 | | DEX | 9 | -1 | -1 | | CON | 17 | +3 | +3 | | INT | 3 | -4 | -4 | | WIS | 11 | +0 | +0 | | CHA | 6 | -2 | -2 | - Senses: Passive Perception 10 - CR 4 (XP 1,100; PB +2) Actions Multiattack. The elephant makes two Gore attacks. Gore. Melee Attack Roll: +8, reach 5 ft. 15 (2d8 + 6) Piercing damage. If the target is a Huge or smaller creature and the elephant moved 20+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target has the Prone condition. Bonus Actions Trample. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 16, one creature within 5 feet that has the Prone condition. Failure: 17 (2d10 + 6) Bludgeoning damage. Success: Half damage.",
    "contentHtml": "<h2 id=\"elephant\">Elephant</h2>\n<p><em>Huge Beast, Unaligned</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 12</li>\n<li><strong>Hit Points:</strong> 76 (8d12 + 24)</li>\n<li><strong>Speed:</strong> 40 ft.</li>\n<li><strong>Initiative</strong>: -1 (9)</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>STAT</th>\n<th>SCORE</th>\n<th>MOD</th>\n<th>SAVE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>STR</td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>+6</td>\n<td>+6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEX</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CON</td>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WIS</td>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n<td>+0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHA</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Senses</strong>: Passive Perception 10</li>\n<li><strong>CR</strong> 4 (XP 1,100; PB +2)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"actions\">Actions</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Multiattack.</em></strong> The elephant makes two Gore attacks.</p>\n<p><strong><em>Gore.</em></strong> <em>Melee Attack Roll:</em> +8, reach 5 ft. 15 (2d8 + 6) Piercing damage. If the target is a Huge or smaller creature and the elephant moved 20+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target has the Prone condition.</p>\n<h3 id=\"bonusactions\">Bonus Actions</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Trample.</em></strong> <em>Dexterity Saving Throw</em>: DC 16, one creature within 5 feet that has the Prone condition. <em>Failure:</em>  17 (2d10 + 6) Bludgeoning damage. <em>Success:</em>  Half damage.</p>",
