    "contentHtml": "<h2 id=\"giantgoat\">Giant Goat</h2>\n<p><em>Large Beast, Unaligned</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 11</li>\n<li><strong>Hit Points:</strong> 19 (3d10 + 3)</li>\n<li><strong>Speed:</strong> 40 ft., Climb 30 ft.</li>\n<li><strong>Initiative</strong>: +1 (11)</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>STAT</th>\n<th>SCORE</th>\n<th>MOD</th>\n<th>SAVE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>STR</td>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>+3</td>\n<td>+5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEX</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CON</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WIS</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHA</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n<td>-2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Skills</strong>: Perception +3</li>\n<li><strong>Senses</strong>: darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 13</li>\n<li><strong>CR</strong> 1/2 (XP 100; PB +2)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"actions\">Actions</h3>\n<p><strong><em>Ram.</em></strong> <em>Melee Attack Roll:</em> +5, reach 5 ft. 6 (1d6 + 3) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature and the goat moved 20+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target takes an extra 5 (2d4) Bludgeoning damage and has the Prone condition.</p>",
    "url": "./html/13_Giant_Goat.html"
