    "title": "Torch (1 CP)",
    "filename": "torch.md",
    "content": "Torch (1 CP) A Torch burns for 1 hour, casting Bright Light in a 20-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 20 feet. When you take the Attack action, you can attack with the Torch, using it as a Simple Melee weapon. On a hit, the target takes 1 Fire damage. Source: 5.2 SRD (D&D 2024) - Adventuring Gear",
    "contentHtml": "<h1 id=\"torch1cp\">Torch (1 CP)</h1>\n<p>A Torch burns for 1 hour, casting Bright Light in a 20-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 20 feet. When you take the Attack action, you can attack with the Torch, using it as a Simple Melee weapon. On a hit, the target takes 1 Fire damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>Source: 5.2 SRD (D&D 2024) - Adventuring Gear</em></p>",
    "url": "./html/torch.html"
